# Build output (workspace target dir; per-crate dirs inherit via workspace)
/target
# The server logging setup, invoked by the Java probes in tools/vanilla-probe (they call
# `Bootstrap.bootStrap()`, as the dedicated server does), writes a logs/ directory into the working
# directory. It is output, not source, and it is not committed.
/logs
# Agent prompt pack: local workflow input, not project source
/mc-rust-agent-prompts
# Local reference snapshots (Paper/Pumpkin/Valence/Minestom exports): read-only
# research input, must never be committed (P00-01, ADR-0001 R-01)
/OpenSourceMinecraftServer